  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Lockstep first stable release with PostQuantum.SecureChannel 1.0.0. No behavior changes of its own; it ProjectReferences PostQuantum.SecureChannel and inherits its wire format (protocol version 2). See the core package's release notes and KNOWN-GAPS.md — note the core is not independently audited.",
